WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 line:0% align:end size:15%
<ruby><rt>kaa.lt</rt></ruby>

00:01:32.097 --> 00:01:35.726 
EPISODE 12: TOMB RAIDER KING

00:01:38.395 --> 00:01:40.731 
Mission accomplished, Boss!

00:01:41.148 --> 00:01:42.566 
Oh... yeah?

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:45.528 
Wasn't easy getting rid
of those Americans,

00:01:45.611 --> 00:01:47.988 
but there's nothing we can't do!

00:01:48.072 --> 00:01:49.031 
So anyway...

00:01:49.114 --> 00:01:50.115 
Oh, this is, uh...

00:01:50.991 --> 00:01:53.786 
What the hell were you guys doing?

00:01:55.871 --> 00:01:57.873 
Anyway, good work.

00:01:57.957 --> 00:02:00.125 
Now I can finally awaken this thing.

00:02:01.377 --> 00:02:04.046 
Whoa, wait! What is this feeling?

00:02:04.129 --> 00:02:09.593 
This inexplicable longing,
this warmth and attraction...

00:02:09.677 --> 00:02:12.179 
It's as though I've
found my missing half.

00:02:12.513 --> 00:02:14.682 
Hey, Master! Who is that?

00:02:15.349 --> 00:02:17.309 
So your instincts recognize him.

00:02:17.393 --> 00:02:19.770 
Be patient. I'll introduce
you two in a moment.

00:02:22.022 --> 00:02:23.274 
What's the big idea?!

00:02:23.858 --> 00:02:26.318 
Y-You have to be gentle with him, Boss!

00:02:26.402 --> 00:02:29.154 
You'll damage the leaves
if you're too rough.

00:02:29.238 --> 00:02:32.116 
No, no! I hate this human!

00:02:32.199 --> 00:02:34.159 
His dominance is terrifying!

00:02:34.243 --> 00:02:35.995 
Help me, you lot!

00:02:36.287 --> 00:02:39.832 
I'm just moving you into a bigger home.

00:02:39.915 --> 00:02:41.417 
Ow! That hurts!

00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:46.463 
Oh, how exhilarating! This must be fate!

00:02:46.547 --> 00:02:48.215 
Who is this disgusting fellow?!

00:02:48.299 --> 00:02:49.592 
Ew! I'm getting goosebumps!

00:02:49.675 --> 00:02:51.385 
– Now, add plenty of soil on top...
– Go away!

00:02:51.468 --> 00:02:53.846 
Now, add plenty of soil on top...

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:57.474 
And then we'll add a
little more dominance.

00:02:57.975 --> 00:03:00.185 
What? Dominance?!

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:10.946 
It's growing fruit!

00:03:11.488 --> 00:03:13.198 
Incredible!

00:03:15.159 --> 00:03:16.702 
Perfect.

00:03:17.786 --> 00:03:21.665 
Irene-san, the juice from these
fruits will heal your parents.

00:03:21.749 --> 00:03:24.752 
- Let's go.
- All right!

00:03:26.587 --> 00:03:27.838 
Breaking news.

00:03:27.922 --> 00:03:30.758 
Kiera Clark of the US military
has been identified as

00:03:30.841 --> 00:03:34.136 
the person responsible for the
disappearance of the children in Bent.

00:03:34.219 --> 00:03:39.642 
Investigators were shocked to learn that
the children were forced into heavy labor.

00:03:39.725 --> 00:03:45.230 
Allegedly, they were mentally
controlled by a relic, as well.

00:03:46.815 --> 00:03:49.652 
Boss, how did this make
the news so quickly?

00:03:49.735 --> 00:03:53.197 
Old Edward works fast, I guess.

00:03:53.530 --> 00:03:56.909 
Was this report part of your plan?

00:03:59.411 --> 00:04:01.705 
THIS TOMB HAS BEEN CONQUERED BY HUMANS.
HUMAN ITEMS CAN THEREFORE BE USED.

00:04:01.789 --> 00:04:03.207 
Huh.

00:04:04.249 --> 00:04:06.293 
I even have cell service.

00:04:08.045 --> 00:04:13.384 
I sent Edward photos and videos
of the children harvesting tea.

00:04:13.467 --> 00:04:14.802 
Great plan, right?

00:04:16.512 --> 00:04:21.892 
I didn't expect him to get it on
the news so quickly, though.

00:04:21.976 --> 00:04:24.186 
It's going viral, too.

00:04:24.269 --> 00:04:27.439 
Bent's president has announced the
country's withdrawal from Pandora.

00:04:27.523 --> 00:04:29.441 
Just as planned.

00:04:29.525 --> 00:04:34.071 
The US State Department has stated
that Kiera Clark was working alone,

00:04:34.905 --> 00:04:37.908 
That puts Pandora under
considerable pressure, too.

00:04:37.992 --> 00:04:39.284 
to rule out organized involvement.

00:04:39.368 --> 00:04:42.287 
Irene-san, don't worry
about Pandora right now.

00:04:42.371 --> 00:04:44.707 
Focus on healing your parents.

00:04:45.749 --> 00:04:48.544 
I will. Thank you so much.

00:04:48.627 --> 00:04:50.629 
How can I ever repay you?

00:04:56.051 --> 00:04:58.178 
What is that over there?

00:05:01.682 --> 00:05:03.183 
C-Corpses?!

00:05:05.185 --> 00:05:06.603 
I'm going back!

00:05:06.687 --> 00:05:08.689 
Everybody out, now!

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:10.691 
Why?!

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:14.403 
What happened?!

00:05:16.947 --> 00:05:18.574 
Bullet holes?

00:05:22.619 --> 00:05:24.204 
Mom! Dad!

00:05:24.288 --> 00:05:25.205 
No!

00:05:25.289 --> 00:05:26.415 
Irene-san, wait!

00:05:33.005 --> 00:05:34.465 
George!

00:05:39.511 --> 00:05:41.472 
It's all right. He's still alive.

00:05:44.016 --> 00:05:46.268 
Damn it... We were attacked...

00:05:46.351 --> 00:05:47.478 
George!

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:49.855 
He's hurt bad!

00:05:50.272 --> 00:05:52.357 
Do you remember the attackers?

00:05:53.108 --> 00:05:56.820 
They came... out of
a framed... painting...

00:05:57.237 --> 00:05:58.572 
Go check their room.

00:05:58.655 --> 00:05:59.782 
Okay!

00:06:02.743 --> 00:06:07.247 
It was Kiera. She's the only one
capable of something like this.

00:06:07.873 --> 00:06:09.625 
They're both gone!

00:06:13.754 --> 00:06:15.798 
Don't worry.

00:06:16.215 --> 00:06:18.300 
I'll find your parents.

00:06:18.759 --> 00:06:20.260 
But first, we have to save George.

00:06:20.344 --> 00:06:23.222 
Ow! That hurts, human!

00:06:23.305 --> 00:06:26.266 
Here, eat this.
You'll be good as new afterward.

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:28.727 
No, it's... too late for me...

00:06:28.811 --> 00:06:30.229 
Don't be an idiot!

00:06:30.771 --> 00:06:32.648 
Shut up and chew!

00:06:35.984 --> 00:06:38.695 
Are you trying to save me or kill me?!

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:42.658 
Wow...

00:06:42.741 --> 00:06:43.867 
What is this?

00:06:43.951 --> 00:06:45.536 
See? What'd I tell you?

00:06:45.619 --> 00:06:47.538 
Thank goodness you're all right!

00:06:49.206 --> 00:06:51.667 
Sorry I worried you, Irene. I'm okay now.

00:06:52.334 --> 00:06:53.544 
But our parents—

00:06:53.627 --> 00:06:55.129 
Don't worry.

00:06:55.212 --> 00:06:58.715 
They weren't kidnapped.

00:06:59.091 --> 00:07:03.595 
What are you saying? I saw them get
pulled into the painting with my own eyes!

00:07:04.388 --> 00:07:06.014 
Those two were fakes.

00:07:06.098 --> 00:07:07.224 
What?!

00:07:07.641 --> 00:07:12.146 
I had him make copies of them
before we left for Bent.

00:07:12.229 --> 00:07:14.523 
Hi. Boy, what a relief.

00:07:16.233 --> 00:07:21.530 
You damn con artist! I've been caring
for fake parents all this time?!

00:07:21.613 --> 00:07:24.908 
Please calm down!
I only did what I was told!

00:07:24.992 --> 00:07:28.245 
It's thanks to him that we
prevented a real kidnapping.

00:07:30.998 --> 00:07:33.333 
I'm truly relieved.

00:07:33.417 --> 00:07:37.504 
But how did you plan that far ahead?

00:07:37.963 --> 00:07:40.883 
Did you somehow know this would happen?

00:07:40.966 --> 00:07:43.552 
No. I just like to be prepared.

00:07:44.011 --> 00:07:47.806 
Someone deliberately made
your parents' condition worse.

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:51.977 
I didn't want to stand by and
let something even worse happen.

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:54.688 
Tsk. I can't believe you tricked me, too.

00:07:54.771 --> 00:07:57.482 
Anyway, take us to our parents now.

00:07:57.566 --> 00:07:59.693 
I will. Just relax.

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:02.654 
We'll leave right away to treat them.

00:08:02.738 --> 00:08:03.739 
And then...

00:08:04.239 --> 00:08:08.202 
we'll get revenge on the
woman who's behind all this.

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:16.293 
You guys head to that address.

00:08:16.376 --> 00:08:18.545 
– And don't you dare lose the tree.
– Right, right.

00:08:18.629 --> 00:08:21.673 
That thing is worth far
more than your lives.

00:08:21.757 --> 00:08:23.133 
– I know tha—
– Kiera Clark is with the US military.

00:08:23.217 --> 00:08:24.593 
Kiera Clark is with the US military.

00:08:24.676 --> 00:08:27.346 
How are we going to take her on?

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:30.432 
It'll be hard enough
just to track her down.

00:08:30.891 --> 00:08:35.229 
Don't worry. I expect
she'll come to us first.

00:08:35.687 --> 00:08:38.065 
How's she gonna do that?

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:43.737 
Nice work, Edward.
I knew I could count on you.

00:08:44.238 --> 00:08:47.449 
Well, since you answered,
I suppose you're still alive.

00:08:47.532 --> 00:08:48.951 
Don't let your guard down yet.

00:08:49.034 --> 00:08:53.956 
General Kiera has nothing on her mind
but finding you and tearing you apart.

00:08:54.039 --> 00:08:57.000 
Instead of worrying about me,
maybe you should—

00:08:57.626 --> 00:08:59.169 
A SUSPICIOUS PAINTING IS THREATENING YOU.

00:08:59.711 --> 00:09:00.712 
Stop the car!

00:09:03.173 --> 00:09:05.550 
Everyone out! Right now!

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:11.431 
What the—

00:09:14.393 --> 00:09:15.686 
The car!

00:09:22.317 --> 00:09:25.320 
That's the painting they took
the copies of our parents into!

00:09:25.779 --> 00:09:27.906 
Isn't that a Van Gogh?

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:30.951 
Shouldn't it be in the Netherlands?

00:09:31.034 --> 00:09:33.787 
Found us already?
You didn't give us much of a break.

00:09:38.333 --> 00:09:41.545 
That was quite the trick
you pulled, Goriki Ryoga.

00:09:41.878 --> 00:09:43.297 
Well, well!

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:46.633 
If it isn't the soon-to-be-dismissed
General Kiera.

00:09:46.717 --> 00:09:50.721 
You'll pay for dragging my
reputation through the mud!

00:09:50.804 --> 00:09:53.765 
Wow. I figured you'd be
hiding in some dark corner.

00:09:53.849 --> 00:09:56.518 
You're certainly keeping busy.

00:09:56.852 --> 00:09:58.145 
Get over yourself!

00:09:58.228 --> 00:10:03.066 
Do you really think a pathetic stunt
like that could bring me down?

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:06.486 
Oh, you mean what they
talked about on the news?

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:09.614 
That nonsense means nothing to me.

00:10:09.698 --> 00:10:13.160 
But you will compensate me for the
damage you did to my reputation.

00:10:13.702 --> 00:10:17.289 
I want Irene Holton and the Tree of Life.

00:10:17.372 --> 00:10:20.167 
And your life, too, while we're at it.

00:10:20.625 --> 00:10:21.543 
Ryoga-san...

00:10:21.626 --> 00:10:23.670 
It's all right. She's bluffing.

00:10:23.754 --> 00:10:25.047 
Oh, am I?

00:10:26.173 --> 00:10:28.258 
Aren't you looking for
the missing Holtons?

00:10:28.342 --> 00:10:32.512 
Keep this up if you want
to watch them die.

00:10:33.430 --> 00:10:36.767 
So you're also the reason
they got so sick!

00:10:37.601 --> 00:10:38.977 
Don't worry.

00:10:39.061 --> 00:10:41.605 
I'm keeping them in this painting.

00:10:41.688 --> 00:10:47.152 
Or I could take them out and
put a bullet through their heads.

00:10:47.235 --> 00:10:49.154 
What?! You coward!

00:10:49.237 --> 00:10:51.823 
Are you absolutely sure about that?

00:10:51.907 --> 00:10:52.824 
What?

00:10:52.908 --> 00:10:56.995 
Are you sure the Holtons
are inside that painting?

00:10:57.079 --> 00:11:01.124 
I knew you were a freak,
but I didn't think it was this bad.

00:11:01.208 --> 00:11:04.461 
It seems I've won this round.

00:11:04.544 --> 00:11:06.880 
Bring out the Holtons at once.

00:11:06.963 --> 00:11:10.175 
I'll kill them right before
your eyes, and you can—

00:11:10.258 --> 00:11:11.259 
General!

00:11:11.551 --> 00:11:13.136 
What's the problem?

00:11:13.220 --> 00:11:15.722 
The two you were
keeping in the painting...

00:11:15.806 --> 00:11:18.683 
They're gone.
There's no trace of them anywhere.

00:11:22.354 --> 00:11:23.939 
You thought they were real?
How gullible can you be?!

00:11:24.022 --> 00:11:25.524 
You...

00:11:29.027 --> 00:11:31.363 
What have you done now, Goriki?!

00:11:31.738 --> 00:11:35.534 
I'm not telling you. Trade secret.

00:11:42.124 --> 00:11:44.209 
Wh-What the hell?! My body...

00:11:44.292 --> 00:11:45.794 
B-Boss!

00:11:46.545 --> 00:11:50.715 
I was a fool to think I'd get
anywhere talking to you!

00:11:50.799 --> 00:11:53.927 
I'll put every last one
of you in this painting!

00:11:56.680 --> 00:12:00.016 
What is this?! M-My body
is turning into paint!

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:03.103 
Damn it! Goriki, can't you stop her?!

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:08.108 
THE RELIC REACTS TO
ITS USER'S CHANGING EMOTIONAL STATE.

00:12:10.068 --> 00:12:11.820 
What is that?!

00:12:11.903 --> 00:12:14.823 
THE USER'S EMOTIONS SPIRAL OUT OF CONTROL.

00:12:21.371 --> 00:12:23.415 
G-General! The relic!

00:12:23.498 --> 00:12:25.333 
Wh-What's going on?!

00:12:26.585 --> 00:12:28.336 
That was a close call,

00:12:28.837 --> 00:12:30.714 
but you saved us...

00:12:31.339 --> 00:12:32.632 
Irene-san.

00:12:33.967 --> 00:12:36.386 
It's just as you said.

00:12:36.845 --> 00:12:39.598 
Our parents were not taken hostage.

00:12:40.807 --> 00:12:42.893 
I'll take it from here.

00:12:44.102 --> 00:12:46.438 
All of you, please get to safety.

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:51.902 
We have to get out of here! Hurry!

00:12:51.985 --> 00:12:55.822 
What?! You expect me to run
away and leave my sister here?!

00:12:57.908 --> 00:12:59.993 
You should be more
worried about yourself.

00:13:01.286 --> 00:13:03.288 
Irene Holton is...

00:13:06.416 --> 00:13:10.462 
the most dangerous
human weapon in existence.

00:13:11.087 --> 00:13:13.798 
I'll end this here and now.

00:13:14.633 --> 00:13:17.594 
You're awfully angry.
But what do you expect to do?

00:13:18.136 --> 00:13:22.724 
You made my parents suffer
and tried to kill my brother.

00:13:24.726 --> 00:13:26.144 
I cannot forgive that!

00:13:26.978 --> 00:13:28.313 
Forgive me?

00:13:33.193 --> 00:13:35.570 
You think you're in any
position to say that?

00:13:36.988 --> 00:13:39.074 
Let's find out!

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:50.252 
Irene!

00:13:59.094 --> 00:14:02.597 
Has the Relic of War
always been this powerful?

00:14:02.681 --> 00:14:04.599 
I didn't expect this.

00:14:04.933 --> 00:14:07.060 
Even Irene can't handle it?

00:14:15.652 --> 00:14:20.198 
What? You took a hit from me
and came out unscathed?

00:14:22.075 --> 00:14:25.829 
Th-That's supposed to be
my sweet little sister, Irene?

00:14:25.912 --> 00:14:28.415 
Irene Holton, the Queen of Bankruptcy.

00:14:28.498 --> 00:14:31.001 
I suppose it's my turn now.

00:14:42.971 --> 00:14:44.180 
What in the...

00:15:49.079 --> 00:15:50.497 
It's over.

00:16:19.025 --> 00:16:20.777 
Hey, pull yourself together.

00:16:22.237 --> 00:16:24.072 
There's no time for this.

00:16:24.155 --> 00:16:27.409 
Go to the place I told you
about and heal your parents.

00:16:28.618 --> 00:16:31.496 
The fruit from the tree is already there.

00:16:31.579 --> 00:16:33.748 
R-Right... Okay.

00:16:35.166 --> 00:16:37.669 
Yanagi! You and I are going to see Irene.

00:16:37.752 --> 00:16:39.754 
What? Me?

00:16:49.889 --> 00:16:53.101 
Damn you, Irene Holton...

00:16:53.518 --> 00:16:57.939 
How can it be? Not even
among Pandora's officials

00:16:58.022 --> 00:17:01.901 
have I ever seen someone
with such immense power.

00:17:01.985 --> 00:17:03.695 
First Goriki, and now you.

00:17:03.778 --> 00:17:07.699 
There are too many people with
powers unlike what our intel told us.

00:17:12.620 --> 00:17:14.831 
Is this game of tag over now?

00:17:16.458 --> 00:17:19.627 
I'm not sure I can even
stand up right now.

00:17:19.711 --> 00:17:21.755 
But I haven't lost!

00:17:33.725 --> 00:17:38.688 
My Relic of War can attack
any place in the world.

00:17:39.147 --> 00:17:41.191 
So you still have more up your sleeve?

00:17:41.483 --> 00:17:45.278 
As the name suggests,
it possesses the power of an entire war.

00:17:45.945 --> 00:17:50.283 
It could wipe out an entire city easily.

00:17:56.790 --> 00:17:58.958 
Since it's come to this...

00:18:06.966 --> 00:18:08.760 
Wait, she's not thinking of...

00:18:08.843 --> 00:18:10.887 
Let us descend together...

00:18:12.138 --> 00:18:15.183 
into the depths of hell!

00:18:20.980 --> 00:18:22.023 
Irene!

00:18:30.782 --> 00:18:32.909 
I-Is this right?

00:18:37.956 --> 00:18:40.291 
It's working! He's recovering!

00:18:42.544 --> 00:18:44.963 
Give me more fruit! Hurry!

00:18:45.046 --> 00:18:46.464 
Right!

00:18:46.548 --> 00:18:48.550 
Ow, ow!

00:18:48.633 --> 00:18:52.428 
What are you doing? Be more gentle!
And not so many at once!

00:18:59.060 --> 00:19:00.186 
Dad!

00:19:00.812 --> 00:19:02.981 
George... Where am I?

00:19:09.404 --> 00:19:11.865 
Mom! Do you recognize me?

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:18.621 
Thank you!

00:19:18.705 --> 00:19:20.081 
Thank you all!

00:19:24.919 --> 00:19:28.256 
You really do have
incredible powers, Tree.

00:19:38.516 --> 00:19:40.560 
Um, Ryoga-san?

00:19:47.066 --> 00:19:49.152 
Irene-san! Are you hurt at all?

00:19:49.235 --> 00:19:52.155 
No, everything seems to be all right.

00:19:52.238 --> 00:19:54.866 
Anyway, that sure was a close call.

00:19:54.949 --> 00:19:58.244 
What just happened, exactly?

00:20:00.788 --> 00:20:04.500 
General Kiera has disappeared, too.
Do you think she fled?

00:20:04.918 --> 00:20:06.002 
Fled?

00:20:07.795 --> 00:20:10.340 
THE RELIC OF BANKRUPTCY AND THE RELIC
OF WAR ARE LOCATED NEAR YOU.

00:20:10.423 --> 00:20:12.258 
Of course.

00:20:12.759 --> 00:20:16.346 
A woman that proud would
never simply run away.

00:20:17.805 --> 00:20:22.727 
Irene-san, we may be able to bring her
to her knees without any more fighting.

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:24.646 
Huh? What do you mean?

00:20:24.729 --> 00:20:27.523 
Kiera is definitely close by.

00:20:28.191 --> 00:20:31.319 
But since she's hiding
instead of attacking us...

00:20:31.945 --> 00:20:34.322 
I suspect the risk has taken effect.

00:20:35.281 --> 00:20:36.449 
The risk?

00:20:36.532 --> 00:20:38.576 
It's said that Sekhmet is both

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:41.996 
the goddess of destruction
and Hathor, the goddess of love.

00:20:42.538 --> 00:20:46.417 
The relic therefore carries
the risk of transformation.

00:20:46.960 --> 00:20:50.380 
I'd say she turned into something
as inconspicuous as possible.

00:20:51.381 --> 00:20:52.882 
Boss!

00:20:53.549 --> 00:20:57.595 
I found the relic those guys had on them!

00:20:57.679 --> 00:21:00.974 
It was lying near the collapsed
building, unharmed!

00:21:01.057 --> 00:21:03.518 
You may not know a thing about art,

00:21:03.601 --> 00:21:05.520 
but this is a famous painting by...

00:21:08.398 --> 00:21:11.734 
A relic is still a relic.
You can repair it later.

00:21:12.944 --> 00:21:16.698 
We'll use the map of Zheng He
disguised as a notebook.

00:21:17.740 --> 00:21:21.244 
Go! Find the owner of this relic!

00:21:30.503 --> 00:21:31.796 
Damn it.

00:21:31.879 --> 00:21:34.632 
Of all the times for
the risk to kick in...

00:21:34.716 --> 00:21:36.676 
What did I turn into this time?

00:21:36.759 --> 00:21:38.177 
My body won't obey me.

00:21:38.261 --> 00:21:40.888 
I don't know what I look like,
but I have to get—

00:21:40.972 --> 00:21:43.141 
And where are we going in such a hurry?

00:21:45.852 --> 00:21:48.563 
How adorable.

00:21:49.480 --> 00:21:53.317 
What a treat it is to
see you in this state.

00:21:55.278 --> 00:21:58.489 
How did you know it was me, you bastard?!

00:21:59.198 --> 00:22:01.325 
With the help of a relic, of course.

00:22:01.951 --> 00:22:03.244 
A relic?

00:22:03.327 --> 00:22:09.292 
The whole world is already
fighting for control of the relics.

00:22:09.375 --> 00:22:12.211 
What can you possibly
do about that alone?!

00:22:12.920 --> 00:22:15.256 
What can I do, indeed?

00:22:16.507 --> 00:22:17.967 
Good question.

00:22:19.969 --> 00:22:24.098 
F-Fine! I surrender! You win!

00:22:24.182 --> 00:22:25.475 
What was that?

00:22:25.975 --> 00:22:28.144 
I'm no match for your power.

00:22:28.227 --> 00:22:31.898 
Goriki! I don't know where
you got all this knowledge,

00:22:31.981 --> 00:22:34.692 
but if we combine it
with the might of my army,

00:22:34.776 --> 00:22:37.361 
world domination will
be within our grasp!

00:22:37.445 --> 00:22:38.738 
So how about you and I work together?

00:22:38.821 --> 00:22:41.240 
– So how about you and I work together?
– Work for me.

00:22:46.079 --> 00:22:50.583 
You corrupt scumbags are all the same.

00:22:50.666 --> 00:22:51.793 
What?

00:22:53.544 --> 00:22:55.296 
I've made up my mind.

00:22:55.379 --> 00:22:59.342 
This world only needs one villain.
And I mean me.

00:22:59.884 --> 00:23:03.596 
This marks the beginning
of my quest to bring

00:23:03.679 --> 00:23:05.973 
every relic out there
into my possession.

00:23:08.559 --> 00:23:11.687 
What's wrong with you?
You've lost your mind!

00:23:11.771 --> 00:23:16.150 
And the first thing I'll do is
deal with this little worm.

00:23:16.901 --> 00:23:18.528 
No, don't!